@page
@model ShopWeb.Pages.ShippingPolicyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Shipping policy";
}

<h1>Shipping policy</h1>

<p><em>Silk &amp; Loom OEM scarf studio - effective January 2026</em></p>

<h2>Processing time</h2>
<p>Orders placed before 2:00 PM ET on business days are picked and packed the same day.
Made-to-order and monogrammed items require 3-5 business days before dispatch.</p>

<h2>Carriers and rates</h2>
<p>We ship with UPS, FedEx, USPS, and selected regional carriers. Live rates are calculated
at checkout from your address and cart weight. Orders over
<strong>@PricingCalculator.FormatMoney(PricingCalculator.FreeShippingThreshold)</strong>
ship free with standard service within the continental US.</p>

<h2>Delivery estimates</h2>
<ul>
    <li>US standard: 3-7 business days</li>
    <li>US expedited: 2 business days</li>
    <li>International: 7-14 business days (customs and duties are the recipient's responsibility)</li>
</ul>

<h2>Tracking</h2>
<p>Every shipment gets a tracking number, visible on your <a asp-page="/OrderStatus">order status page</a>
as soon as the label is scanned. If a package shows no movement for 10 business days,
<a href="mailto:support@example.com">contact support</a> and we will open a carrier investigation
or file an insurance claim on your behalf.</p>

<h2>Lost or damaged packages</h2>
<p>Orders are insured to their declared value. For lost shipments we re-ship or refund after
the carrier's investigation window (typically 8 business days). For damage, keep the packaging
and photo-document the item - claims must be filed within 7 days of delivery.</p>
